// `make spec-sync-check` (tools/spec_sync.py). X-macro include consumed by:
//   - runtime/vm.cpp           -> kRuntimeErrorNames[] / runtime_error_id()
//   - frontend/binder/binder.cpp -> is_native_prelude_name()
